# A DIRECTORY qmldir, deliberately not a module.
#
# bin/omarchy-studio runs `qml6 -I editor editor/main.qml`, so main.qml reaches its
# siblings through the implicit import of its own directory. Adding a `module Foo` line
# here turns the directory into a named module and that implicit import stops resolving:
# every type in the app fails to load, and the only symptom is a window that never
# appears while the launcher waits out its timeout.
#
# Both services are singletons because the model must exist exactly once. Bridge holds
# the resolved project state that every component binds to; a second instance would hold
# a second, diverging copy of the project.
singleton Theme 1.0 Theme.qml
singleton Bridge 1.0 Bridge.qml
singleton Style 1.0 Style.qml

# Shared geometry: the camera overlay and the setup self-view must draw the same
# squircle, and layers.py's _squircle_mask must draw it a third time identically.
SquircleShape 1.0 SquircleShape.qml

# The camera-to-screen time conversion, in one place because it is a SIGN.
CameraSync 1.0 CameraSync.qml
